OL,3,GNEWSAHigh ticket gates installed to
OL,4,Adeter fare dodgers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rail operator has become the first in
OL,7,Fthe country to install taller ticket
OL,8,Fbarriers at a station following a trial
OL,9,Fin July.
OL,11,FChiltern Railways has fitted FEnx
OL,12,Fgates, designed by Cubic Transportation
OL,13,FSystems, at both entrances to High
OL,14,FWycombe railway station, serving
OL,15,Fplatforms one, two and three.
OL,17,FIn July, the Department for Transport
OL,18,F(DfT) said taller barriers would be
OL,19,Frolled out across the country as part
OL,20,Fof a #33.4m scheme to combat fare
OL,21,Fdodging.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
