OL,3,GNEWSAHigh ticket gates installed to
OL,4,Adeter fare dodgers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTony Baxter, interim managing director
OL,7,Fof Chiltern Railways, said: "Their size
OL,8,Fand innovative features will not only
OL,9,Fprotect crucial funds lost to fare
OL,10,Fevasion, but they will improve the
OL,11,Fexperience for customers travelling
OL,12,Fthrough the station."
